C LOOK FOR TERRITORY TO EXPLOR IN FRONT
C
	IF (RANG(Y).LE.10) GOTO 2900
comment	IF LOW ON FUEL
	IZOT2=IZOT
comment	STORE IZOT A MOMENT
	Z62=Z6+IARROW(ICORR(IZOT2+1)+1)
